      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - LanguageType: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - LanguageType: 2
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextLanguages:
    - LanguageType: 0
      LanguageGenericType: "Ju\u017C? Wszystko dzia\u0142a? Popatrzy\u0142e\u015B
        sobie na portrety? Mo\u017Cemy ju\u017C wr\xF3ci\u0107 do questa? Zaraz,
        jak to sz\u0142o... "
    - LanguageType: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    - LanguageType: 2
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Sprite: {fileID: 0}
    Name: Chlor
  - NodeGuid: 5a474cfc-706d-461f-bbb8-031f75ad6d27
    Position: {x: 1021, y: 286}
    DialogueNodePorts:
    - PortGuid: 2497c20a-85cc-4a0b-9fe8-e8da20ba3237
      InputGuid: f8bcbdc6-e654-46da-92eb-4bc54e4952cd
      OutputGuid: 5a474cfc-706d-461f-bbb8-031f75ad6d27
      TextLanguages:
      - LanguageType: 0
        LanguageGenericType: Dalej
      - LanguageType: 1
        LanguageGenericType: Continue
      - LanguageType: 2
        LanguageGenericType: Continue
    DialogueFaceImageType: 0
    AudioClips:
    - LanguageType: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - LanguageType: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - LanguageType: 2
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextLanguages:
    - LanguageType: 0
      LanguageGenericType: "B\u0119d\u0119 z tob\u0105 ca\u0142kowicie szczery. Jestem
        lujem. Te delikatesy to m\xF3j drugi dom! Okej, jedyny. \u015Api\u0119 sobie
        pod drzwiami, jak zawsze, a tu nagle jak mnie skurwysyny nie napadli...  "
    - LanguageType: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    - LanguageType: 2
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Sprite: {fileID: 0}
    Name: Chlor
  - NodeGuid: f8bcbdc6-e654-46da-92eb-4bc54e4952cd
    Position: {x: 2043, y: 290}
    DialogueNodePorts:
    - PortGuid: c805ad6e-6058-4f83-84d8-9b7578dcd08d
      InputGuid: 1f3c8d5d-6a11-4113-a9b3-5f3fd30205fa
      OutputGuid: f8bcbdc6-e654-46da-92eb-4bc54e4952cd
      TextLanguages:
      - LanguageType: 0
        LanguageGenericType: "To najbardziej pojebana wym\xF3wka przy \u017Cebraniu
          o kas\u0119 na w\xF3d\u0119, jak\u0105 s\u0142ysza\u0142em "
      - LanguageType: 1
        LanguageGenericType: Continue
      - LanguageType: 2
        LanguageGenericType: Continue
    - PortGuid: 298d8045-70bb-42bc-b0aa-2fd5747cd6a4
      InputGuid: f65b5d9f-34b9-442a-8dae-16d7ece8dbda
      OutputGuid: f8bcbdc6-e654-46da-92eb-4bc54e4952cd
      TextLanguages:
      - LanguageType: 0
        LanguageGenericType: "Czemu sprzedawczyni nie we\u017Amie policji? ?"
      - LanguageType: 1
        LanguageGenericType: Continue
      - LanguageType: 2
        LanguageGenericType: Continue
    DialogueFaceImageType: 0
    AudioClips:
    - LanguageType: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - LanguageType: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - LanguageType: 2
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextLanguages:
    - LanguageType: 0
      LanguageGenericType: "W chuj ich by\u0142o, banda g\xF3wniarzy. Krzyczeli co\u015B
        o lodach ekipy czy chuj wie co. Zajebali mi wszystkie pieni\u0105dze, potem
        chyba godzin\u0119 w sklepie siedzieli i robili awantur\u0119, bo tych ich
        lod\xF3w nie ma. W ko\u0144cu wyszli i widzia\u0142em jak szli w kierunku
        gara\u017Cy. "
    - LanguageType: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    - LanguageType: 2
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Sprite: {fileID: 0}
    Name: Chlor
  - NodeGuid: f65b5d9f-34b9-442a-8dae-16d7ece8dbda
    Position: {x: 3505, y: 341}
    DialogueNodePorts:
    - PortGuid: 79538825-5a8f-42eb-9e12-79eb91fa82bb
      InputGuid: b378506b-63bc-4dbb-8826-0fe7fff9304e
      OutputGuid: f65b5d9f-34b9-442a-8dae-16d7ece8dbda
      TextLanguages:
      - LanguageType: 0
        LanguageGenericType: Dalej
      - LanguageType: 1
        LanguageGenericType: Continue
      - LanguageType: 2
        LanguageGenericType: Continue
    DialogueFaceImageType: 0
    AudioClips:
    - LanguageType: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - LanguageType: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - LanguageType: 2
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextLanguages:
    - LanguageType: 0
      LanguageGenericType: "O, wci\u015Bni\u0119te na si\u0142\u0119 okno dialogowe,
        \u017Ceby da\u0107 graczowi poczucie wyboru, dobre! I tak powiem to samo,
        co przy pierwszej opcji, jak w Wied\u017Aminie! "
    - LanguageType: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    - LanguageType: 2
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Sprite: {fileID: 0}
    Name: Chlor
  - NodeGuid: 1f3c8d5d-6a11-4113-a9b3-5f3fd30205fa
    Position: {x: 3506, y: 104}
    DialogueNodePorts:
    - PortGuid: 7e4b08e3-6e8b-4421-a7dc-b43ccf0ff5c5
      InputGuid: 50f62df2-c3c5-4e52-b957-7fcd795c2db1
      OutputGuid: 1f3c8d5d-6a11-4113-a9b3-5f3fd30205fa
      TextLanguages:
      - LanguageType: 0
        LanguageGenericType: Dalej
      - LanguageType: 1
        LanguageGenericType: Continue
      - LanguageType: 2
        LanguageGenericType: Continue
    DialogueFaceImageType: 0
    AudioClips:
    - LanguageType: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - LanguageType: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - LanguageType: 2
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextLanguages:
    - LanguageType: 0
      LanguageGenericType: "Nie chc\u0119 \u017Cadnych pieni\u0119dzy! Tym bardziej
        na w\xF3d\u0119! W zasadzie to mia\u0142em zamiar p\xF3j\u015B\u0107 na odwyk,
        nawet odk\u0142ada\u0142em i kupi\u0142em esperal. No i w\u0142a\u015Bnie
        to mi zajebali razem ze wszystkimi drobnymi! Jest ich za du\u017Co, a ja
        jeszcze mam kaca po wczoraj. "
    - LanguageType: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    - LanguageType: 2
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Sprite: {fileID: 0}
    Name: Chlor
  - NodeGuid: 50f62df2-c3c5-4e52-b957-7fcd795c2db1
    Position: {x: 4939, y: 111}
    DialogueNodePorts:
    - PortGuid: cde1c4af-2d56-400d-bb8b-111990fe7fdb
      InputGuid: edb9c56e-275a-43b2-b031-68c5bb7b7c98
      OutputGuid: 50f62df2-c3c5-4e52-b957-7fcd795c2db1
      TextLanguages:
      - LanguageType: 0
        LanguageGenericType: "Mmm... cukierasy ( \u0CA0 \u035C\u0296\u0CA0) "
      - LanguageType: 1
        LanguageGenericType: Continue
      - LanguageType: 2
        LanguageGenericType: Continue
    - PortGuid: d6e3d74d-4ffa-4e4d-a0de-6ec815e1515b
      InputGuid: 5a66a3ba-4e02-4aa6-bdbb-e9a8f124fe80
